he `mid`, `vmid` or `up_mid` parameter.\n\nThe files the brief names are all there: `accounts/account_manager/account_mgr.dart`, `lib/utils/accounts.dart`, and `download_service.dart`, `download_manager.dart` and `download_extras.dart` under `lib/services/download/`. I found nothing that contradicts the brief. One detail it leaves out: the login-mode switch and the \"hide interaction\" switch are both read through `Pref` in `storage_pref.dart`, not directly from `storage.dart`.\n\n[warmup-complete]","ttft_ms":3445,"type":"result","duration_ms":11666,"uuid":"b1390eb0-9ae7-46ab-9435-ad84c28e4a1a","ttft_stream_ms":2615,"time_to_request_ms":510,"first_content_frame_ms":2616,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
